    - "Reduz pela metade o tempo de produ\xE7\xE3o de pranchas."
  - key: skill.Quarry1.description
    values:
    - "\u0423\u043C\u0435\u043D\u044C\u0448\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043C\u044F
      \u0434\u043E\u0431\u044B\u0447\u0438 \u043A\u0430\u043C\u043D\u044F \u0432\u0434\u0432\u043E\u0435."
    - Reduces stone mining time by half.
    - "R\xE9duit de moiti\xE9 le temps d\u2019extraction de pierre."
    - "\u77F3\u5934\u5F00\u91C7\u65F6\u95F4\u51CF\u5C11\u4E00\u534A\u3002"
    - "Riduce della met\xE0 il tempo di estrazione della pietra."
    - "Reduziert die Steinabbauzeit um die H\xE4lfte."
    - "Reduce el tiempo de extracci\xF3n de piedra a la mitad."
    - "Reduz pela metade o tempo de minera\xE7\xE3o de pedras."
