  - key: skill.MillBuild1.description
    values:
    - "\u0412\u043E\u0441\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043D\u0430\u0432\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442
      \u043C\u0435\u043B\u044C\u043D\u0438\u0446\u0443."
    - Repairs the mill.
    - "R\xE9pare le moulin."
    - "\u4FEE\u7406\u78E8\u574A\u3002"
    - Ripara il mulino.
    - "Repariert die M\xFChle."
    - Repara el molino.
    - Repara o moinho.
  - key: skill.BoarTree1.description
    values:
    - "\u0412 \u043B\u0435\u0441\u0430\u0445 \u043D\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043D\u0430\u044E\u0442
      \u0432\u043E\u0434\u0438\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F \u043A\u0430\u0431\u0430\u043D\u044B."
    - Boars begin to inhabit the forests.
    - "Les sangliers commencent \xE0 habiter les for\xEAts."
    - "\u91CE\u732A\u5F00\u59CB\u6816\u606F\u5728\u68EE\u6797\u91CC\u3002"
    - I cinghiali iniziano ad abitare nelle foreste.
    - "Wildschweine beginnen, die W\xE4lder zu besiedeln."
    - "Los jabal\xEDes comienzan a habitar los bosques."
    - "Os javalis come\xE7am a habitar as florestas."
  - key: skill.AutoClickWorker1.description
    values:
    - "\u041D\u0430 \u0432\u0442\u043E\u0440\u043E\u043C \u043A\u0440\u0443\u0433\u0435
      \u043F\u043E\u044F\u0432\u043B\u044F\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044F \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043E\u0447\u0438\u0439,
      \u043A\u043E\u0442\u043E\u0440\u044B\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0443\u0435\u0442
      \u0430\u0432\u0442\u043E\u043C\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043A\u0438."
    - An automatic worker appears on the second ring.
    - "Un travailleur automatique appara\xEEt sur la deuxi\xE8me sonnerie."
    - "\u4E00\u4E2A\u81EA\u52A8\u5DE5\u4F5C\u4EBA\u5458\u51FA\u73B0\u5728\u7B2C\u4E8C\u4E2A\u73AF\u4E0A\u3002"
    - Sul secondo squillo appare un lavoratore automatico.
    - Beim zweiten Klingeln erscheint ein automatischer Arbeiter.
    - "Un trabajador autom\xE1tico aparece en el segundo anillo."
    - "Um trabalhador autom\xE1tico aparece no segundo toque."
  - key: skill.RedSwordsman1.description
    values:
    - "\u0423\u0432\u0435\u043B\u0438\u0447\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0437\u0434\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0432\u044C\u0435
      \u043C\u0435\u0447\u043D\u0438\u043A\u0430 \u043D\u0430 10."
    - Increases swordsman health by 10.
    - "Augmente la sant\xE9 de l'\xE9p\xE9iste de 10."
    - "\u4F7F\u5251\u58EB\u751F\u547D\u503C\u589E\u52A0 10 \u70B9\u3002"
    - Aumenta la salute dello spadaccino di 10.
    - "Erh\xF6ht die Gesundheit des Schwertk\xE4mpfers um 10."
    - "Aumenta la salud del espadach\xEDn en 10."
    - "Aumenta a sa\xFAde do espadachim em 10."
  - key: skill.RedSwordsman2.description
    values:
    - "\u0423\u0432\u0435\u043B\u0438\u0447\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0443\u0440\u043E\u043D
      \u043C\u0435\u0447\u043D\u0438\u043A\u0430 \u043D\u0430 5."
    - Increases swordsman damage by 5.
    - "Augmente les d\xE9g\xE2ts de l'\xE9p\xE9iste de 5."
    - "\u5251\u58EB\u4F24\u5BB3\u589E\u52A0 5 \u70B9\u3002"
    - Aumenta il danno dello spadaccino di 5.
    - "Erh\xF6ht den Schaden des Schwertk\xE4mpfers um 5."
    - "Aumenta el da\xF1o del espadach\xEDn en 5."
    - Aumenta o dano do espadachim em 5.
  - key: skill.RedSwordsman3.description
    values:
    - "\u0414\u0430\u0451\u0442 \u043C\u0435\u0447\u043D\u0438\u043A\u0443 \u0440\u0435\u0433\u0435\u043D\u0435\u0440\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044E
      \u0432\u043D\u0435 \u0431\u043E\u044F: 5 \u0437\u0434\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0432\u044C\u044F
      \u0432 \u0441\u0435\u043A\u0443\u043D\u0434\u0443."
    - Grants the swordsman 5 health per second outside combat.
    - "Accorde \xE0 l'\xE9p\xE9iste 5 points de vie par seconde en dehors des combats."
    - "\u4F7F\u5251\u5BA2\u5728\u6218\u6597\u5916\u6BCF\u79D2\u83B7\u5F97 5 \u70B9\u751F\u547D\u503C\u3002"
    - Conferisce allo spadaccino 5 punti salute al secondo fuori dal combattimento.
    - "Gew\xE4hrt dem Schwertk\xE4mpfer au\xDFerhalb des Kampfes 5 Gesundheit pro
      Sekunde."
    - "Otorga al espadach\xEDn 5 de salud por segundo fuera del combate."
    - Concede ao espadachim 5 pontos de vida por segundo fora do combate.
  - key: skill.RedArcher1.description
    values:
    - "\u0423\u0432\u0435\u043B\u0438\u0447\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0437\u0434\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0432\u044C\u0435
      \u043B\u0443\u0447\u043D\u0438\u043A\u0430 \u043D\u0430 10."
    - Increases archer health by 10.
    - "Augmente la sant\xE9 de l'archer de 10."
    - "\u5F13\u7BAD\u624B\u751F\u547D\u503C\u589E\u52A0 10 \u70B9\u3002"
    - Aumenta la salute dell'arciere di 10.
    - "Erh\xF6ht die Gesundheit des Bogensch\xFCtzen um 10."
    - Aumenta la salud del arquero en 10.
    - "Aumenta a sa\xFAde do arqueiro em 10."
  - key: skill.Archer0Hex1.description
    values:
    - "\u041D\u0430 \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0432\u043E\u043C \u043A\u0440\u0443\u0433\u0435
      \u0433\u0435\u043A\u0441\u043E\u0432 \u043F\u043E\u044F\u0432\u043B\u044F\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044F
      \u043B\u0443\u0447\u043D\u0438\u043A."
    - An archer appears on the first ring of hexes.
    - "Un archer appara\xEEt sur le premier anneau d'hexagones."
    - "\u4E00\u540D\u5F13\u7BAD\u624B\u51FA\u73B0\u5728\u7B2C\u4E00\u5708\u516D\u89D2\u5F62\u4E0A\u3002"
    - Un arciere appare sul primo anello di esagoni.
    - "Ein Bogensch\xFCtze erscheint auf dem ersten Hexenring."
    - "Aparece un arquero en el primer anillo de hex\xE1gonos."
    - "Um arqueiro aparece no primeiro anel de hex\xE1gonos."
