    values:
    - "\u041D\u0435 \u0442\u0440\u0443\u0441, \u0430 \u043E\u0441\u0442\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0436\u043D\u044B\u0439"
    - Not cowardly, but cautious
    - "Pas l\xE2che, mais prudent"
    - "\u4E0D\u662F\u80C6\u602F\uFF0C\u800C\u662F\u8C28\u614E"
    - Non codardo, ma cauto
    - Nicht feige, aber vorsichtig
    - No cobarde, sino cauteloso.
    - "N\xE3o covarde, mas cauteloso"
  - key: base.castle_popup.decree.cautious.description
    values:
    - "\u0415\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u0437\u0434\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0432\u044C\u0435
      \u0432\u043E\u0438\u043D\u0430 \u0443\u043F\u0430\u043B\u043E \u043D\u0438\u0436\u0435
      10%, \u0442\u043E \u0432\u043E\u0438\u043D \u0431\u0435\u0436\u0438\u0442 \u0441
      \u043F\u043E\u043B\u044F \u0431\u043E\u044F \u0432 \u043F\u043E\u0440\u0442\u0430\u043B."
    - If a warrior's health falls below 10%, they flee the battlefield through the
      portal.
    - "Si la sant\xE9 d'un guerrier tombe en dessous de 10 %, il fuit le champ de
      bataille par le portail."
    - "\u5982\u679C\u6218\u58EB\u7684\u751F\u547D\u503C\u4F4E\u4E8E 10%\uFF0C\u4ED6\u4EEC\u5C31\u4F1A\u901A\u8FC7\u4F20\u9001\u95E8\u9003\u79BB\u6218\u573A\u3002"
    - Se la salute di un guerriero scende al di sotto del 10%, fugge dal campo di
      battaglia attraverso il portale.
    - "Wenn die Gesundheit eines Kriegers unter 10 % f\xE4llt, flieht er durch das
      Portal vom Schlachtfeld."
    - "Si la salud de un guerrero cae por debajo del 10%, huye del campo de batalla
      a trav\xE9s del portal."
    - "Se a sa\xFAde de um guerreiro cair abaixo de 10%, ele foge do campo de batalha
      atrav\xE9s do portal."
