      \u0434\u0435\u043D\u044C \u043F\u043E\u043B\u043D\u043E\u0441\u0442\u044C\u044E
      \u0432\u043E\u0441\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043D\u0430\u0432\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442
      \u0437\u0434\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0432\u044C\u0435.\n\u041A\u043E\u043B\u0435\u0441\u043E
      \u043C\u044B\u0448\u0438 \u2013 \u043F\u0440\u043E\u043A\u0440\u0443\u0442\u043A\u0430
      \u0445\u0430\u0440\u0430\u043A\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043A."
    - "Kill: {0} XP \xB7 assist: {1} XP\nA new day restores health completely.\nMouse
      wheel \u2013 scroll statistics."
    - "Tuer\_: {0} XP \xB7 Assister\_: {1} XP\nUn nouveau jour restaure compl\xE8tement
      la sant\xE9.\nMolette de la souris \u2013 d\xE9filement des statistiques."
    - "\u51FB\u6740\uFF1A{0} XP \xB7 \u534F\u52A9\uFF1A{1} XP\n\u65B0\u7684\u4E00\u5929\u5B8C\u5168\u6062\u590D\u5065\u5EB7\u3002\n\u9F20\u6807\u6EDA\u8F6E
      \u2013 \u6EDA\u52A8\u7EDF\u8BA1\u6570\u636E\u3002"
    - "Uccisione: {0} XP \xB7 assistenza: {1} XP\nUn nuovo giorno ripristina completamente
      la salute.\nRotellina del mouse: scorri le statistiche."
    - "T\xF6tung: {0} XP \xB7 Assist: {1} XP\nEin neuer Tag stellt die Gesundheit
      vollst\xE4ndig wieder her.\nMausrad \u2013 Statistiken scrollen."
    - "Matar: {0} XP \xB7 asistencia: {1} XP\nUn nuevo d\xEDa restaura la salud por
      completo.\nRueda del mouse: desplazamiento de estad\xEDsticas."
    - "Matar: {0} XP \xB7 ajudar: {1} XP\nUm novo dia restaura completamente a sa\xFAde.\nRoda
      do mouse \u2013 estat\xEDsticas de rolagem."
