  - key: game.text.7e5e2354db351041
    values:
    - "\u0411\u044B\u0441\u0442\u0440\u044B\u0439 \u0432\u0440\u0430\u0433 \u0431\u043B\u0438\u0436\u043D\u0435\u0433\u043E
      \u0431\u043E\u044F \u0441 \u043A\u043B\u0438\u043D\u043A\u043E\u043C. \u041E\u043F\u0430\u0441\u0435\u043D
      \u0432 \u0433\u0440\u0443\u043F\u043F\u0435."
    - A fast melee enemy with a blade. Dangerous in groups.
    - "Un ennemi de m\xEAl\xE9e rapide avec une lame. Dangereux en groupe."
    - "\u6301\u5200\u7684\u5FEB\u901F\u8FD1\u6218\u654C\u4EBA\u3002\u7FA4\u4F53\u5371\u9669\u3002"
    - Un nemico corpo a corpo veloce con una lama. Pericoloso in gruppo.
    - "Ein schneller Nahkampfgegner mit einer Klinge. Gef\xE4hrlich in Gruppen."
    - "Un enemigo cuerpo a cuerpo r\xE1pido con una espada. Peligroso en grupos."
    - "Um inimigo corpo a corpo r\xE1pido com uma l\xE2mina. Perigoso em grupos."
  - key: game.text.94d6a1118cf339fd
    values:
    - "\u0411\u044C\u0451\u0442 \u0441\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0430\u0439\u043D\u043E\u0433\u043E
      \u0432\u0440\u0430\u0433\u0430 \u0432 \u0440\u0430\u0434\u0438\u0443\u0441\u0435
      2,6. \u0418\u0433\u043D\u043E\u0440\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0435\u0442 \u0431\u0440\u043E\u043D\u044E;
      \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0442\u0438\u0432 \u0431\u0440\u043E\u043D\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0430\u043D\u043D\u044B\u0445
      +50%."
    - Strikes a random enemy within 2.6 units. Ignores armor; +50% damage against
      armored enemies.
    - "Frappe un ennemi al\xE9atoire dans un rayon de 2,6 unit\xE9s. Ignore l'armure\_;
      +50% de d\xE9g\xE2ts contre les ennemis blind\xE9s."
    - "\u968F\u673A\u653B\u51FB 2.6 \u5355\u4F4D\u5185\u7684\u4E00\u540D\u654C\u4EBA\u3002\u5FFD\u7565\u62A4\u7532\uFF1B\u5BF9\u88C5\u7532\u654C\u4EBA
      +50% \u4F24\u5BB3\u3002"
    - "Colpisce un nemico casuale entro 2,6 unit\xE0. Ignora l'armatura; +50% ai
      danni contro i nemici corazzati."
    - "Trifft einen zuf\xE4lligen Feind innerhalb von 2,6 Einheiten. Ignoriert R\xFCstung;
      +50 % Schaden gegen gepanzerte Feinde."
    - "Golpea a un enemigo aleatorio dentro de 2,6 unidades. Ignora la armadura;
      +50% de da\xF1o contra enemigos blindados."
    - "Atinge um inimigo aleat\xF3rio dentro de 2,6 unidades. Ignora armadura; +50%
      de dano contra inimigos blindados."
  - key: game.text.d87258280102fdf1
    values:
    - "\u0412 \u0431\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0430\u0440\u0438\u0438 \u043F\u043E\u043A\u0430
      \u043D\u0435\u0442 \u0437\u0430\u043F\u0438\u0441\u0435\u0439."
    - No bestiary entries yet.
    - "Aucune entr\xE9e de bestiaire pour l'instant."
    - "\u8FD8\u6CA1\u6709\u52A8\u7269\u5BD3\u8A00\u6761\u76EE\u3002"
    - Nessuna voce nel bestiario ancora.
    - "Noch keine Bestiarium-Eintr\xE4ge."
    - "A\xFAn no hay entradas de bestiario."
    - "Ainda n\xE3o h\xE1 entradas no besti\xE1rio."
  - key: game.text.7e266c8170b2f65b
    values:
    - "\u0412\u041D\u0418\u041C\u0410\u041D\u0418\u0415! 50% \u0448\u0430\u043D\u0441
      \u0433\u0438\u0431\u0435\u043B\u0438."
    - WARNING! 50% chance of death.
    - "AVERTISSEMENT\_! 50% de chances de mourir."
    - "\u8B66\u544A\uFF01 50%\u7684\u6B7B\u4EA1\u673A\u4F1A\u3002"
    - "ATTENZIONE! 50% di possibilit\xE0 di morte."
    - ACHTUNG! 50 % Todeswahrscheinlichkeit.
    - "\xA1ADVERTENCIA! 50% de probabilidad de muerte."
    - AVISO! 50% de chance de morte.
  - key: game.text.a6b627cff0852044
    values:
    - "\u0412\u0430\u0448\u0435 \u0412\u0435\u043B\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0432\u043E,
      \u0443\u043A\u0440\u044B\u0442\u0438\u044E \u043D\u0443\u0436\u043D\u044B \u043F\u0440\u0438\u043F\u0430\u0441\u044B.\n\u041E\u0442\u043F\u0440\u0430\u0432\u044C\u0442\u0435
      \u043B\u044E\u0434\u0435\u0439 \u0447\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0437 \u043F\u043E\u0440\u0442\u0430\u043B
      \u0438 \u0434\u043E\u0431\u0443\u0434\u044C\u0442\u0435 \u0435\u0434\u0443,
      \u0434\u0440\u0435\u0432\u0435\u0441\u0438\u043D\u0443 \u0438 \u043A\u0430\u043C\u0435\u043D\u044C.
      \u042F \u043F\u043E\u0434\u0433\u043E\u0442\u043E\u0432\u043B\u044E \u0434\u043B\u044F
      \u0432\u0430\u0441 \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0432\u043E\u0435 \u043F\u043E\u0440\u0443\u0447\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435."
    - 'Your Majesty, the shelter needs supplies.

      Send people through the portal
      to gather food, wood and stone. I will prepare your first task.'
    - "Votre Majest\xE9, le refuge a besoin de fournitures.\nEnvoyez des gens via
      le portail pour r\xE9cup\xE9rer de la nourriture, du bois et des pierres. Je
      vais pr\xE9parer votre premi\xE8re t\xE2che."
    - "\u965B\u4E0B\uFF0C\u907F\u96BE\u6240\u9700\u8981\u7269\u8D44\u3002\n\u6D3E\u4EBA\u901A\u8FC7\u4F20\u9001\u95E8\u6536\u96C6\u98DF\u7269\u3001\u6728\u6750\u548C\u77F3\u5934\u3002\u6211\u4F1A\u51C6\u5907\u4F60\u7684\u7B2C\u4E00\u4E2A\u4EFB\u52A1\u3002"
    - "Vostra Maest\xE0, il rifugio ha bisogno di provviste.\nInvia persone attraverso
      il portale per raccogliere cibo, legno e pietra. Preparer\xF2 il tuo primo
      compito."
    - "Eure Majest\xE4t, das Tierheim braucht Vorr\xE4te.\nSchicke Leute durch das
      Portal, um Nahrung, Holz und Steine \u200B\u200Bzu sammeln. Ich bereite Ihre
      erste Aufgabe vor."
    - "Su Majestad, el refugio necesita suministros.\nEnv\xEDa gente a trav\xE9s
      del portal para recolectar comida, madera y piedra. Preparar\xE9 tu primera
      tarea."
    - 'Majestade, o abrigo precisa de suprimentos.

      Envie pessoas pelo portal
      para coletar comida, madeira e pedra. Vou preparar sua primeira tarefa.'
  - key: game.text.2018da51e5eb0907
    values:
    - "\u0412\u0434\u0432\u043E\u0435 \u0443\u043C\u0435\u043D\u044C\u0448\u0430\u0435\u0442
      \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043C\u044F \u0434\u043E\u0431\u044B\u0447\u0438 \u0434\u0440\u0435\u0432\u0438\u0441\u0438\u043D\u044B"
    - Halves wood harvesting time
    - "R\xE9duit de moiti\xE9 le temps de r\xE9colte du bois"
    - "\u6728\u6750\u91C7\u4F10\u65F6\u95F4\u51CF\u534A"
    - Dimezza il tempo di raccolta del legno
    - Halbiert die Holzerntezeit
    - "Reduce a la mitad el tiempo de recolecci\xF3n de madera"
    - Reduz pela metade o tempo de colheita de madeira
  - key: game.text.2d28e89d164d9764
    values:
