  - key: game.text.58125db67049aaef
    values:
    - "\u0412\u043E\u0438\u043D\u044B \u0432\u043E\u0437\u0432\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0430\u044E\u0442\u0441\u044F
      \u043A \u043F\u043E\u0440\u0442\u0430\u043B\u0443, \u043A\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430
      \u0438\u0445 \u0437\u0434\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0432\u044C\u0435 \u043F\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0435\u0442
      \u0434\u043E 10%."
    - Warriors return to the portal when their health falls to 10%.
    - "Les guerriers reviennent au portail lorsque leur sant\xE9 tombe \xE0 10 %."
    - "\u5F53\u6218\u58EB\u7684\u751F\u547D\u503C\u964D\u81F3 10% \u65F6\uFF0C\u4ED6\u4EEC\u4F1A\u8FD4\u56DE\u4F20\u9001\u95E8\u3002"
    - I guerrieri ritornano al portale quando la loro salute scende al 10%.
    - "Krieger kehren zum Portal zur\xFCck, wenn ihre Gesundheit auf 10 % sinkt."
    - Los guerreros regresan al portal cuando su salud cae al 10%.
    - "Os guerreiros retornam ao portal quando sua sa\xFAde cai para 10%."
  - key: game.text.0b21876c6f8cf08c
    values:
    - "\u0412\u043E\u0438\u043D\u044B \u043E\u0442\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043F\u0430\u044E\u0442
      \u043A \u043F\u043E\u0440\u0442\u0430\u043B\u0443, \u043A\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430
      \u0437\u0434\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0432\u044C\u0435 \u043F\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0435\u0442
      \u0434\u043E 10%."
    - Warriors retreat to the portal when their health falls to 10%.
    - "Les guerriers se retirent vers le portail lorsque leur sant\xE9 tombe \xE0
      10 %."
    - "\u5F53\u6218\u58EB\u7684\u751F\u547D\u503C\u4E0B\u964D\u5230 10% \u65F6\uFF0C\u4ED6\u4EEC\u4F1A\u64A4\u9000\u5230\u4F20\u9001\u95E8\u3002"
    - I guerrieri si ritirano nel portale quando la loro salute scende al 10%.
    - "Krieger ziehen sich zum Portal zur\xFCck, wenn ihre Gesundheit auf 10 % sinkt."
    - Los guerreros se retiran al portal cuando su salud cae al 10%.
    - "Os guerreiros recuam para o portal quando sua sa\xFAde cai para 10%."
  - key: game.text.02f2d60fe3a498c5
    values:
    - "\u0412\u043E\u0438\u043D\u044B \u0443 \u043F\u043E\u0440\u0442\u0430\u043B\u0430
      \u0432\u043E\u0441\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043D\u0430\u0432\u043B\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044E\u0442
      1% \u0437\u0434\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0432\u044C\u044F \u0432 \u0441\u0435\u043A\u0443\u043D\u0434\u0443."
    - Warriors near the portal restore 1% health per second.
    - "Les guerriers pr\xE8s du portail restaurent 1% de sant\xE9 par seconde."
    - "\u4F20\u9001\u95E8\u9644\u8FD1\u7684\u6218\u58EB\u6BCF\u79D2\u6062\u590D 1%
      \u751F\u547D\u503C\u3002"
    - I guerrieri vicino al portale ripristinano l'1% della salute al secondo.
    - "Krieger in der N\xE4he des Portals stellen 1 % ihrer Gesundheit pro Sekunde
      wieder her."
    - Los guerreros cerca del portal recuperan un 1% de salud por segundo.
    - "Guerreiros pr\xF3ximos ao portal restauram 1% da sa\xFAde por segundo."
  - key: game.text.37671b41b1a3e40f
    values:
    - "\u0412\u0440\u0435\u043C\u044F \u0432 \u0437\u0430\u0431\u0435\u0433\u0435:
      00:00:00"
    - 'Run time: 00:00:00'
    - "Dur\xE9e d'ex\xE9cution\_: 00:00:00"
    - "\u8FD0\u884C\u65F6\u95F4\uFF1A00:00:00"
    - 'Durata: 00:00:00'
    - 'Laufzeit: 00:00:00'
    - "Hora de ejecuci\xF3n: 00:00:00"
    - "Tempo de execu\xE7\xE3o: 00:00:00"
  - key: game.text.47b30d2701356ff3
    values:
    - "\u0412\u044B \u0435\u0449\u0451 \u043F\u043E\u043C\u043D\u0438\u0442\u0435
      \u043A\u0430\u043A \u0443\u043F\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043B\u044F\u0442\u044C \u043F\u043E\u0434\u0434\u0430\u043D\u043D\u044B\u043C\u0438?
      \u041D\u0430\u0440\u043E\u0434\u0443 \u043D\u0443\u0436\u043D\u0430 \u0432\u0430\u0448\u0430
      \u0434\u043B\u0430\u043D\u044C."
    - Do you still remember how to command your subjects? Your people need your guiding
      hand.
    - Vous rappelez-vous encore comment commander vos sujets ? Votre peuple a besoin
      de votre main directrice.
    - "\u4F60\u8FD8\u8BB0\u5F97\u5982\u4F55\u6307\u6325\u4F60\u7684\u81E3\u6C11\u5417\uFF1F\u60A8\u7684\u4EBA\u6C11\u9700\u8981\u60A8\u7684\u6307\u5BFC\u4E4B\u624B\u3002"
    - Ricordi ancora come comandare i tuoi sudditi? La tua gente ha bisogno della
      tua mano guida.
    - "Erinnern Sie sich noch daran, wie Sie Ihren Untertanen Befehle erteilen? Ihre
      Leute brauchen Ihre f\xFChrende Hand."
    - "\xBFA\xFAn recuerdas c\xF3mo mandar a tus s\xFAbditos? Tu gente necesita tu
      mano gu\xEDa."
    - "Voc\xEA ainda se lembra de como comandar seus s\xFAditos? Seu pessoal precisa
      de sua m\xE3o orientadora."
  - key: game.text.497fc1306d467393
    values:
    - "\u0412\u044B \u043D\u0435 \u0443\u0441\u043F\u0435\u043B\u0438 \u0441\u0431\u0435\u0436\u0430\u0442\u044C,
      \u043F\u043E\u0440\u0442\u0430\u043B \u0431\u044B\u043B \u0443\u043D\u0438\u0447\u0442\u043E\u0436\u0435\u043D."
    - You did not escape in time. The portal was destroyed.
    - "Vous ne vous \xEAtes pas \xE9chapp\xE9 \xE0 temps. Le portail a \xE9t\xE9
      d\xE9truit."
    - "\u4F60\u6CA1\u6709\u53CA\u65F6\u9003\u8131\u3002\u4F20\u9001\u95E8\u88AB\u6467\u6BC1\u4E86\u3002"
    - "Non sei scappato in tempo. Il portale \xE8 stato distrutto."
    - "Du bist nicht rechtzeitig entkommen. Das Portal wurde zerst\xF6rt."
    - No escapaste a tiempo. El portal fue destruido.
    - "Voc\xEA n\xE3o escapou a tempo. O portal foi destru\xEDdo."
