    - "\u63D2\u69FD{0}\n{1} \xB7 \u4EBA\u7269\uFF1A{2} \xB7 \u9B54\u6CD5\u77FF\u77F3\uFF1A{3}"
    - "Slot {0}\n{1} \xB7 Persone: {2} \xB7 Minerale magico: {3}"
    - "Steckplatz {0}\n{1} \xB7 Personen: {2} \xB7 Magisches Erz: {3}"
