      \u0431\u0430\u0448\u043D\u0438 \u0435\u0449\u0451 \u043D\u0430 10%. \u0412\u0441\u0435\u0433\u043E:
      \u221210%. \u041E\u043A\u0440\u0443\u0433\u043B\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435 \u0432\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0445,
      \u043C\u0438\u043D\u0438\u043C\u0443\u043C 1 \u043A\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043B\u043B."
    - 'Reduces crystals required for every tower level by another 10%. Total reduction:
      10%. Rounded up, minimum 1 crystal.'
    - "R\xE9duit les cristaux requis pour chaque niveau de tour de 10 % suppl\xE9mentaires.
      R\xE9duction totale : 10%. Arrondi, minimum 1 cristal."
    - "\u6BCF\u4E2A\u5854\u5C42\u6240\u9700\u7684\u6C34\u6676\u518D\u51CF\u5C11 10%\u3002\u603B\u51CF\u5C11\u91CF\uFF1A10%\u3002\u56DB\u820D\u4E94\u5165\uFF0C\u6700\u5C11
      1 \u4E2A\u6C34\u6676\u3002"
    - 'Riduce i cristalli richiesti per ogni livello della torre di un altro 10%.
      Riduzione totale: 10%. Arrotondato per eccesso, minimo 1 cristallo.'
    - "Reduziert die ben\xF6tigten Kristalle f\xFCr jede Turmebene um weitere 10
      %. Gesamterm\xE4\xDFigung: 10 %. Aufgerundet, mindestens 1 Kristall."
    - "Reduce los cristales necesarios para cada nivel de torre en otro 10%. Reducci\xF3n
