  - key: menu.slots.delete_confirm
    values:
    - "\u0412\u044B \u0434\u0435\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043B\u044C\u043D\u043E
      \u0445\u043E\u0442\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0443\u0434\u0430\u043B\u0438\u0442\u044C
      \u044D\u0442\u043E \u0441\u043E\u0445\u0440\u0430\u043D\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435?\n\u0414\u0430\u043D\u043D\u043E\u0435
      \u0434\u0435\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0438\u0435 \u043D\u0435\u043E\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0438\u043C\u043E."
    - 'Are you sure you want to delete this save?

      This action cannot be undone.'
    - "\xCAtes-vous s\xFBr de vouloir supprimer cette sauvegarde\_?\nCette action
      ne peut pas \xEAtre annul\xE9e."
    - "\u60A8\u786E\u5B9A\u8981\u5220\u9664\u6B64\u4FDD\u5B58\u5417\uFF1F\n\u6B64\u64CD\u4F5C\u65E0\u6CD5\u64A4\u6D88\u3002"
    - "Sei sicuro di voler eliminare questo salvataggio?\nQuesta azione non pu\xF2
      essere annullata."
    - "Sind Sie sicher, dass Sie diesen Speicherstand l\xF6schen m\xF6chten?\nDiese
      Aktion kann nicht r\xFCckg\xE4ngig gemacht werden."
    - "\xBFEst\xE1s seguro de que deseas eliminar este guardado?\nEsta acci\xF3n
      no se puede deshacer."
    - "Tem certeza de que deseja excluir este salvamento?\nEsta a\xE7\xE3o n\xE3o
      pode ser desfeita."
